# judge-do-force

EXPORT TEMPLATE judge-do-force:
  ABOUT   judge rule for every DO line — a force level is written with its primitive (MUST, NEVER…), never inside the DO
  TAGS    #judge

  SLOTS:
    action: TEXT  "the action the agent performs, as a plain imperative"
      SHOULD not open with a word setting how firmly to act, like 'never', 'always', 'must', 'do not' or 'make sure'
  BODY:
    DO {action}
  EXAMPLE:
    DO run npm test before declaring done
